Day 60 – WordPress + MySQL Kubernetes Capstone 🚀

Today I practiced a basic WordPress + MySQL setup using Kubernetes.

What I learned:

- Created a MySQL Deployment
- Created a MySQL Service
- Created a WordPress Deployment
- Connected WordPress with MySQL Service
- Created a WordPress NodePort Service
- Verified Pods and Services

Kubernetes flow:

WordPress Pod
     ↓
WordPress Service
     ↓
MySQL Service
     ↓
MySQL Pod

Commands practiced:

kubectl apply -f day-60-mysql.yaml
kubectl apply -f day-60-mysql-service.yaml
kubectl apply -f day-60-wordpress.yaml
kubectl apply -f day-60-wordpress-service.yaml

kubectl get pods -n dev
kubectl get svc -n dev

